 "remarks": "Spacious Styling Gem! Elegant Corner-Condo. Spacious 1100sqft with 2 Full Baths. Located Downtown at Boutique Luxury Condominium \"The Classic\" 25 Forest. A prestigious 24/7 Concierge service and an upscale high-rise. Bright, double sized Living room with space to entertain. Beautifully designer painted throughout. Gourmet Kitchen With Gas Stove. Balcony With Beautiful Sunsets Views. Large Primary Bedroom With Lots Of Closets And Walk-In-Closet. Beautiful Limestone Bath. RARE - 2nd Hall Bath with Walk-In-Shower! Washer/Dryer In Unit! Bonus Gated Garage with Deeded Space Included. Enjoy the 18th Flr \"Classic Club\" with top-tier amenities: All-Season Pool, fitness center, lounge, Plus 3rd flr Park With Grills. Hallways recently renovated. Pet Friendly. Washer/Dryer in Unit. Enjoy City Living at its finest! Located Near Stamford Restaurants, Town Center, Pickleball, Train- Metro North, Theaters And more. Buy Today!",
